      },
      {
        "native_id": "bwxg9c0nn2np",
        "status": "monitoring",
        "body": "As of 22:00 UTC, we have identified the root cause with our banking partner and expect affected payouts to land by the end of the day. We will continue to monitor closely and post further updates as needed.",
